<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Themed-icon layer (Android 13+): the same fingerpost, one colour, pointed, on a post. Not a plain arrow — an arrow could
  be any app; a signpost is this one.

  Android shows only the central 72 of these 108, and guarantees only the central
  66-diameter circle, so the mark is sized to sit inside that circle: it survives
  a round mask and it still reads at 48px, which is the size that decides whether
  an icon works.
-->
